# Radioactive Spider {G}, 1/1 reach, deathtouch: "Fateful Bite ... Activate only as a sorcery." On turn 2 (Bot2's main phase) Bot1 has Mox Ruby and Mox Jet
# untapped to pay {2} and may not activate it (the refusal). On turn 4 Bot2's Air Elemental (4/4 flying) attacks: the Spider, with reach, blocks it and
# its deathtouch kills the Elemental though it deals only 1 damage; the Spider dies too.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Radioactive Spider
Forest x3
Masked Meower
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Air Elemental
Island x3
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Radioactive Spider.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Radioactive Spider.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Air Elemental.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Air Elemental > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Radioactive Spider > Air Elemental)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Air Elemental; Black Lotus
Bot1.Graveyard = Radioactive Spider
Bot1.Life = 20
